{"id": "11", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "[calm, serious] Reset economy? [pause] All Robux will turn back into game currency. [pause] Your three million Robux will become... just Robux."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "[hesitating, soft] Three million..."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "[reflective] I thought about the mansion. The gold toothbrush. The hundred friends who vanished as soon as the money did."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "[pause] And then I looked at the two people who stayed."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "[soft] The friend who waited outside my party in one shoe. [pause] And the sister who came back for me in the rain."}, {"speaker": "PICKLE", "text": "[encouraging] Whatever you pick, Ty... I'll still share my umbrella with you."}, {"speaker": "MIA", "text": "[softer than usual] ...Yeah. Me too. [pause] Don't make it weird."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "[determined, shouts] RESET!"}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 8.44, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 143, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "bIHbv24MWmeRgasZH58o", "start_time_seconds": 8.44, "end_time_seconds": 11.200000000000001, "character_start_index": 143, "character_end_index": 178, "dialogue_input_index": 1}, {"voice_id": "bIHbv24MWmeRgasZH58o", "start_time_seconds": 11.200000000000001, "end_time_seconds": 17.76, "character_start_index": 178, "character_end_index": 299, "dialogue_input_index": 2}, {"voice_id": "bIHbv24MWmeRgasZH58o", "start_time_seconds": 17.76, "end_time_seconds": 20.8, "character_start_index": 299, "character_end_index": 354, "dialogue_input_index": 3}, {"voice_id": "bIHbv24MWmeRgasZH58o", "start_time_seconds": 20.8, "end_time_seconds": 27.04, "character_start_index": 354, "character_end_index": 469, "dialogue_input_index": 4}, {"voice_id": "cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9", "start_time_seconds": 27.04, "end_time_seconds": 31.439999999999998, "character_start_inde